+    <section anchor="prnet" numbered="false" removeInRFC="false" toc="exclude" pn="section-3">
+      <name slugifiedName="name-prnet">PRNET</name>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-3-1">There is no priority indication.  The two choices are to use the
+station routing vs. point-to-point routing, or to require
+acknowledgments vs. having no acknowledgments.  The mapping of PRNET
+parameters into IP TOS parameters can be as follows.</t>
